 layout->addWidget(new QLabel(QString::fromUtf8("ЖУРНАЛ СОБЫТИЙ")));auto*journal=new QPlainTextEdit;journal->setReadOnly(true);journal->setMaximumHeight(90);journal->setMaximumBlockCount(100);layout->addWidget(journal);
 auto refresh=[&](){for(int i=0;i<3;i++){auto*model=static_cast<NavigationSensor*>(sensors[i]);model->setReady(ready[i]->isChecked());model->setAccuracy(accuracy[i]->value());model->setCount(counts[i]->value());}Sensor*best=choose_best_sensor(sensors);plot->best=best;plot->update();QString message=best?QString::fromUtf8("Активный источник: %1   •   ± %2 м").arg(best->name()).arg(best->accuracy(),0,'f',1):QString::fromUtf8("Нет доступных датчиков — навигация остановлена");status->setText(message);status->setStyleSheet(best?"background:#163c43;color:#6cf0db;border-radius:9px;padding:16px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600":"background:#492a36;color:#ffbac7;border-radius:9px;padding:16px;font-size:18px;font-weight:600");for(int i=0;i<3;i++)frames[i]->setStyleSheet(best==sensors[i]?"QFrame#card{border:2px solid #42e4d2}":"QFrame#card{border:1px solid #294058}");if(best)best->read();journal->appendPlainText(QTime::currentTime().toString("HH:mm:ss")+"  "+message);};
 for(int i=0;i<3;i++){QObject::connect(ready[i],&QCheckBox::toggled,&window,[&]{refresh();});QObject::connect(accuracy[i],&QDoubleSpinBox::valueChanged,&window,[&]{refresh();});QObject::connect(counts[i],&QSpinBox::valueChanged,&window,[&]{refresh();});}
 QObject::connect(off,&QPushButton::clicked,&window,[&]{ready[0]->setChecked(false);});QObject::connect(all,&QPushButton::clicked,&window,[&]{for(auto*c:ready)c->setChecked(false);});QObject::connect(reset,&QPushButton::clicked,&window,[&]{for(int i=0;i<3;i++){QSignalBlocker b(ready[i]),a(accuracy[i]),c(counts[i]);ready[i]->setChecked(true);accuracy[i]->setValue(i==0?1.5:i==1?2:3.2);counts[i]->setValue(i==0?10:i==1?8:124);}refresh();});refresh();window.show();
 const auto args=app.arguments();int shot=args.indexOf("--screenshot");if(shot>=0&&shot+1<args.size())QTimer::singleShot(600,&window,[&]{window.grab().save(args[shot+1]);app.quit();});
 if(args.contains("--gui-test"))QTimer::singleShot(100,&window,[&]{int f=0;off->click();if(plot->best!=&glonass)f++;all->click();if(plot->best)f++;reset->click();if(plot->best!=&gps)f++;accuracy[2]->setValue(.2);if(plot->best!=&visual)f++;counts[2]->setValue(60);if(visual.read()!=60)f++;qDebug()<<"GUI scenarios failures:"<<f;app.exit(f);});
 return app.exec();
